# NIGHTBLOOM — the glasshouse after dark. Ptyxis palette.
# Jade leads, amber signs (the cursor is the one firefly), growlight
# violet is rare (magenta slot only). Dark = the conservatory at night,
# Light = the same glasshouse at noon on bone paper.

